   "notes": "## Changelog\n* ea1e0b0 Add timestamps to join/leave and re-style to match classic Hotline client\n* f8b224b Add usage to readme\n* 4cf5f45 Apply theming to huh forms\n* 9ea31dc Convert theming to use AdaptiveColor for better light/dark terminal compatibility\n* da530a5 Delete temp file\n* 5d8c331 Display usage if config is bad instead of exit 1 with no output.\n* 2491579 Drop light theme and unify on dark (for now)\n* a2be260 Fix account management issues\n* 3c94a14 Improve threaded news article UX\n* e3a7eb3 Initial multi-session support\n* e554e99 Initial theme support\n* 62a2fb2 Merge pull request #3 from erichelgeson/master\n* 5057be4 More style tweaks\n* d393274 Refactor screens to tea.View\n* 5a1eb1f Remove hardcoded stylings\n* 48d9ce0 Store config in homedir dotfile\n* 70fa8a9 Style cleanup\n* 38b6882 Style tweaks\n* 20c42e6 Update charmbracelet dependencies to latest stable releases\n* 944fc7b Update to charmbracelet v2 modules\n* a257e87 Use charmtone colors for theming\n* 9ccc630 ignore binary and move yaml to example so users dont accidentally commit passwords.\n\n",
